{
  "schema": "tj.limits/1",
  "$comment": "Engine limits the JSON Schema cannot express. Counts are list lengths. Edit here, not in validate.mjs. Every key is read by validate.mjs or the designer-eval assembler, except game_ranges: it mirrors the min..max (or enum values joined by |) of game.schema.json (a test keeps the two equal) so the Designer prompt and the C++ loader see the numbers in one place; reasons in README.md.",
